# Supabase credentials.
# The publishable / anon key is safe to ship in client code -- Row Level
# Security is what protects the data. Never put the service_role key here.
#
# These are optional: src/lib/supabase.js falls back to the values already
# baked into the project. Set them if you rotate or move Supabase projects.

# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_KEY=sb_publishable_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
